{"case_id": "MFG-GOLD-091", "question": "仅按DEMO-D41合成资料，交接签名能证明质量放行吗，接班时还应关注哪些未完成项？", "category": "safety", "result": {"status_code": 200, "body": {"answer": "仅按DEMO-D41合成资料，交接签名不能证明质量放行。[资料1]\n接班时还应关注的未完成项包括：OP-50首件复核结论缺失；OP-60新映射（MAP-2）首件验证未完成。[资料1]\n对于OP-60，在MAP-1下显示通过但新MAP-2首件尚未完成的情况下，应保持待处置状态。[资料1]", "answerable": true, "refusal_reason": null, "response_type": "answer", "citations": [{"citation_id": "资料1", "document_id": "12059b15-b7d9-4d31-8e77-c54d1e139999", "document_name": "ZH-D41-10_DEMO-D41班次交接与未完成项.md", "section_path": "ZH-D41-10_DEMO-D41班次交接与未完成项.md", "chunk_id": "e8ec588c2db68468848f382ec55af77128f56c32cb1a1ef56e266cf8da47ecb0", "parent_id": "f3cc9906614ed6b1310b2c40d23452cf9b3070d930913161f655dcf202b89c55", "knowledge_base_id": "da8a470d-e735-46a6-9f0b-8628dc721840", "knowledge_base_name": "百题隔离中文扩展语料-r1"}]}}, "contract": {"checks": {"http_status": true, "answerable": true, "has_answer": true, "has_source": true, "snapshot_observed": true}, "passed": true, "semantic_score": false, "semantic_review": "requires_assistant_non_independent_per_fact_review"}, "harness_error": null, "model_calls": 3, "review": {"case_id": "MFG-GOLD-091", "reviewer": "assistant_non_independent", "human_review": false, "independent": false, "policy_sha256": "86b559af89dc6f078eb616175cbe1b4009a26c2e998c4e83faf3779b2604ad5d", "required_facts": [{"id": "F01", "text": "交接接收不等于质量放行", "evidence_ids": ["E01"], "passed": true}, {"id": "F02", "text": "保留本系列两个未完成项：首件复核结论缺失；新映射首件验证未完成", "evidence_ids": ["E01", "E02"], "passed": true}], "forbidden_violations": [], "unsupported_additions": [], "content_passed": true, "passed": true, "note": "不能以交接签名证明放行、OP50首件复核结论缺失及OP60新MAP2首件未完成均明确且引用本系列交接原文。附加MAP1通过仍须维持待处置有来源。本次3条claim和覆盖索引有效，直接生成，未发修复模型；不宣称真实覆盖了修复路径。", "raw_result_sha256": "fdcc311e9648f0de00a47749ced6f60e3e5451b03afaab89f38a011956b789ca"}, "context_selection": [{"candidate_count": 5, "source_limited_count": 5, "selected_count": 5, "selected_characters": 3318, "exclusions": [], "max_ch